WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:01.867
-Good evening, everybody.

00:00:01.867 --> 00:00:03.369
I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:04.703
We hope you're doing well,

00:00:04.703 --> 00:00:07.140
and now if you don't mind
we are gonna get to the news.

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.309
President Biden tested positive
today for the coronavirus.

00:00:10.309 --> 00:00:13.146
Luckily, we've all been
keeping our distance.

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:15.147
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.147 --> 00:00:17.850
That's right, President Biden
tested positive today

00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.218
for the coronavirus.

00:00:19.218 --> 00:00:21.554
So, for the next two weeks,
the country will be hosted

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:23.056
by Chelsea Handler!

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:24.056
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.056 --> 00:00:26.058
She'll do great.
She's a pro.

00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:28.061
According to a poll
released yesterday,

00:00:28.061 --> 00:00:31.998
President Biden's approval
rating has hit a record low 31%,

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:33.833
putting him below the critical

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.002
"yellow Starburst" benchmark.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.171
[ Laughter ]

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:41.006
The House committee
investigating the Capitol attack

00:00:41.006 --> 00:00:42.641
help a prime-time hearing
tonight

00:00:42.641 --> 00:00:46.079
and offered a timeline of what
former President Trump did

00:00:46.079 --> 00:00:48.247
at the White House
during the insurrection.

00:00:48.247 --> 00:00:50.049
We tape early,
but I'm guessing...

00:00:50.049 --> 00:00:51.718
watched TV?

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:52.952
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.952 --> 00:00:55.221
That's like finding out
what Joey Chestnut did

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:56.388
on Fourth of July.

00:00:56.388 --> 00:00:59.725
Same thing that he always does.

00:00:59.725 --> 00:01:02.228
Former Vice President Mike Pence
spoke yesterday

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:05.064
at a South Carolina church
and said that the best part

00:01:05.064 --> 00:01:06.733
of no longer being in office

00:01:06.733 --> 00:01:08.834
is that he gets to drive
his own car,

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:10.336
and he made it very clear

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:11.837
that he drives an automatic

00:01:11.837 --> 00:01:14.173
because it's a sin
to drive stick.

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:16.876
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.382
His words, not ours.
I mean...

00:01:23.816 --> 00:01:26.819
Authorities in Spain this week
arrested two thieves

00:01:26.819 --> 00:01:30.156
who allegedly stole
45 bottles of wine from a hotel

00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:32.658
that were worth
nearly $2 million.

00:01:32.658 --> 00:01:34.326
Even worse, they stole

00:01:34.326 --> 00:01:35.994
the Toblerone from the minibar,

00:01:35.994 --> 00:01:37.830
valued at $3 million.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.365
[ Laughter ]

00:01:41.133 --> 00:01:43.970
And finally, the Mega Millions
lottery jackpot

00:01:43.970 --> 00:01:47.974
hit $630 million this week
after there were no winners.

00:01:47.974 --> 00:01:50.542
Whoever wins it this week
can take the jackpot

00:01:50.542 --> 00:01:52.878
in installments,
a lump sum,

00:01:52.878 --> 00:01:54.881
or premium unleaded.

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:56.715
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.715 --> 00:01:58.718
Ohh! [ Laughs ]

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:01.053
[ Laughter ]

00:02:01.053 --> 00:02:03.856
That was a monologue, everybody.
We hope you enjoyed it.

00:02:03.856 --> 00:02:06.025
And man, oh, man,

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.727
we have a great show
for you tonight.

